om/users/vignesh-j-shetty/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-29T16:08:01Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T16:08:01Z","body":"<img width=\"880\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14b34fda-ad4d-406f-ba9c-0a4d2436b0d7\" />\n\n@AThousandShips  Is this fine?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2763608238/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764255403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104732#issuecomment-2764255403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104732","id":2764255403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kwzCr","user":{"login":"samanime","id":3005690,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDU2OTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3005690?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime","html_url":"https://github.com/samanime","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samanime/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-29T21:49:37Z","updated_at":"2025-03-29T22:16:54Z","body":"I don't see why it is an invalid plugin name though? I think slashes should be legal in the plugin name, no reason they aren't. The name works perfectly fine if you also manually provide a subfolder value.\n\nThey just can't be used for other values derived from that plugin name automatically.\n\nI feel like replacing the slash with a _ (and maybe any other non-alphanumeric, non-hyphen, non-underscore characters), just like spaces are, makes more sense.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764255403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764351896","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104732#issuecomment-2764351896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104732","id":2764351896,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kxKmY","user":{"login":"vignesh-j-shetty","id":52810607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODEwNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52810607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty","html_url":"https://github.com/vignesh-j-shetty","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vignesh-j-shetty/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T02:44:47Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T02:49:08Z","body":"> I don't see why it is an invalid plugin name though? I think slashes should be legal in the plugin name, no reason they aren't. The name works perfectly fine if you also manually provide a subfolder value.\n> \n> They just can't be used for other values derived from that plugin name automatically.\n> \n> I feel like replacing the slash with a _ (and maybe any other non-alphanumeric, non-hyphen, non-underscore characters), just like spaces are, makes more sense.\n\nI think throwing a validation error is the better approach. Automatically replacing / with _ modifies the user’s intended name without their consent, which might lead to unexpected behavior. It’s better to make the restriction clear upfront so users can explicitly define a valid name themselves if needed.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764351896/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764444283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104732#issuecomment-2764444283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104732","id":2764444283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kxhJ7","user":{"login":"0xblarky","id":191610850,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2u_4g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191610850?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky","html_url":"https://github.com/0xblarky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xblarky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T08:15:56Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T08:27:58Z","body":"> I don't see why it is an invalid plugin name though? I think slashes should be legal in the plugin name, no reason they aren't. The name works perfectly fine if you also manually provide a subfolder value.\n> \n> They just can't be used for other values derived from that plugin name automatically.\n> \n> I feel like replacing the slash with a _ (and maybe any other non-alphanumeric, non-hyphen, non-underscore characters), just like spaces are, makes more sense.\n\n@samanime Using '/' to name a file is bad practice according to me. A dev may need to use terminal or any command prompt to navigate and the '/' may cause some problems and should be under illegal phrasing. Using an underscore is a better practice as its readability is better and won't cause any issues as you have mentioned. \n\nEdit- Should I implement a function which checks for invalid phrases in project name? The function will check and replace the invalid phrase with valid ones","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764444283/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]